<h1 style="font-size:22px;margin:0 0 12px;">Confirm your email address</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Hi <%= user.first_name %>, welcome to <%= settings.store_name %>! Please confirm your email address so we can keep your order history safe.</p>
<p style="margin:20px 0;"><a href="<%= link %>" style="display:inline-block;background:#D81E1E;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 20px;border:2px solid #111111;">Confirm my email</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;color:#555555;">Or copy this link into your browser:<br><%= link %></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#555555;">The link is valid for 48 hours. If you did not create an account, you can ignore this email.</p>
